From: "vincent.yen" <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 01:58:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add MiTAC firmware downgrade verification

Add MiTAC minimum ship level verification to the firmware activation
flow.

Support NONE, VER, and DATE downgrade policies from the image
MANIFEST. Compare BMC and BIOS firmware versions.

| Manifest Setting       | Purpose  | Verification                                                                          | Result                                     |
|------------------------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| Field missing or empty | Any      | Do not perform downgrade verification                                                 | Success                                    |
| NONE                   | BMC/BIOS | Compare the target version with the current version                                   | Failure when target < current              |
| VER:<version>          | BMC/BIOS | Both current and target must be greater than or equal to the minimum                  | Failure when either value is < minimum     |
| DATE:yyyymmdd          | BMC only | Both current and target build dates must be greater than or equal to the minimum date | Failure when either date is < minimum date |
| Any other value        | Any      | Treat as an invalid format                                                            | Failure                                    |

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
